// media/consumers — named constructions → representations (not Orisha).
//
// One-stem companion: this file + consumers.kz. HTML library/item/play,
// JSON-LD (catalog graph + optional semantic overlay), Link, media/art/subtitle
// bytes. Local nfo overlay (plot/aired/rating), graph hydrate overlay
// (posters/actors keyed by [tt…]), trailer chips, edition pickers (3D vs flat),
// and extras grouped by soundtrack / featurette / document.
// Settings (/settings) configures library mounts (capability + affordances),
// catalogue keys, sign-in, and flags binary reindex/hydrate.
// Reads media/graph; does not parse JSON itself. No Koru-level events —
// dispatch calls pub Zig. Handlers never call TMDB, TVDB, or ffmpeg.
